   "locked": false,
   "text": "Check the real destination list: aws bedrock get-inference-profile --inference-profile-identifier au.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5\nNZ data on au. can be processed in Australia. In-region keeps it in one Region, if the model is offered there.\nEnforce with an IAM condition on bedrock:InferenceProfileArn plus an SCP. Residency is about location; sovereignty (whose law applies) is a question for legal.",
   "originalText": "Check the real destination list: aws bedrock get-inference-profile --inference-profile-identifier au.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5\nNZ data on au. can be processed in Australia. In-region keeps it in one Region, if the model is offered there.\nEnforce with an IAM condition on bedrock:InferenceProfileArn plus an SCP. Residency is about location; sovereignty (whose law applies) is a question for legal.",
